; KOFXI - Shuttle 2 -- for Ikemen-GO 1.0
;
; CREDITS. Two claims, kept apart because they are not the same claim:
;
;   THE STAGE IS SNK CORPORATION'S. Every vertex, texture, palette and
;   animation table this file points at was authored by SNK for
;   KOF XI, and came off a retail PS2 disc. None of it is licensed and
;   none of it is ours to hand out; this def does not make it free, it only
;   says where the bytes already were. NOT FOR COMMERCIAL USE.
;
;   THE READING OF IT IS VANS'S. What no disc holds is what the bytes
;   MEAN. Every number in this file was derived or measured, and none was
;   tuned until it merely looked right; that is the work `author` names
;   below, and it is not a claim over the art it moves.
;
; NO DECODE HAPPENS IN ISOLATION. Each of the people below made a non-trivial
; contribution to -- or left a mark on -- the eventual understanding of these
; formats. What follows each name is THEIR work: a tool they wrote, data they
; mined, notes they shared, testing they did, a format they taught first-hand.
; Alphabetically, because no other order would be fair. Where a line names a
; particular game in this series, that is where the work was done; the list
; itself is the whole toolchain's and is the same in every export:
;
;   aokmaniac13     AnimView.jar
;   DarkSaviour     data mining and note sharing across the KOF series
;   IronMUGEN       taught the author the NeoGeo KOF data formats
;   Jesuszilla      help producing the KOF XI data mining table for
;                   Cheat Engine
;   JJWE            the original data mining effort on KOF XI
;   K.O.D           stress testing the data outputs
;   Keku            beta testing these stage exports, and establishing
;                   that the game runs at 640x480 and the PS2 shows a
;                   448-line crop of it
;   KoopaKoot       stress testing the data outputs
;   Melody-Yoshi    KOF11CV.EXE
;   Pharaon         taught the author the NeoGeo KOF data formats
;
; Special thanks: Balthazar, Bia, Byakko, Caddie, [E], extravagant,
;                 Inktrebuchet, Jmorphman, Kamekaze, Kong, Kung_Fu_Man,
;                 ManyNinjas, MC2, Misamu K. Young, Rednavi, Sander 71113,
;                 Serio, Thedge, TMasta, TTTTTsd, Walt, Warusaki3, wuwo,
;                 XGargoyle.
;
; Claude Opus 5 (Anthropic) assisted throughout, on the decoding and on this
; file. The judgement calls stayed human; the model was an instrument for
; reaching them, and is named for the same reason everything else here is.
;
; DISCLAIMER. A fan-made conversion, released free and for non-commercial use
